    "canonical_ref": "PL19.TRI.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "O socii, exclamat, jam tempus sumere tela, Quandoquidem hic, sanie perfusus membra, pro- [pinquat, Praedaturus opes nostras, umbrasque animasque.",
