    "canonical_ref": "PL19.TRI.4.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Obstupuit prior ipse Charon, seque abdit in ulva, Et canis obstupuit claudens tria Cerberus ora, Gorgones, Harpiaeque tremunt,",
